{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "7f0e5bc9-192d-8225-8b98-75d64d5027ff",
  "created_at": "2026-02-09T10:00:52-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Nelson Vieira",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:58:36-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:58:39-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, good morning Kevin. Nelson Vieira. I'm calling about a puddle in front of my place, and I use the word puddle loosely, it's a small pond."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:58:49-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a pond. Where are you located?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:58:52-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "359 Kay Street, up in the Historic Hill. It covers about half the road. And here's the thing, it hasn't rained in a week, maybe more. Ground's dry everywhere else. So where's the water coming from?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:59:05-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Huh. So it's just sitting there, not draining."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:59:09-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sitting there. Cars go around it, people tiptoe around it. Sorry, one second, I'm wrapping a present for the secret Santa at work, a little late I know, and the tape keeps sticking to everything. Okay, I'm back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:59:23-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No worries. Have you reported this before?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:59:26-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I called a while back and somebody told me Kay Street is a state road, so it's not the city's problem. Which, fine, but the drain is right there and the city's name is on the manhole cover as far as I'm concerned. Passing the buck is what that is."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:59:44-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I hear you. I'm writing this down, half the road, standing water, no rain for about a week, 359 Kay. I'll check on the road ownership on my end, because it can be mixed depending on the stretch."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T09:59:58-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that'd be a nice change. So will you open a work order? That's what I want to know. And for what date, because I'm not interested in hearing someone will look into it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:00:11-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can open the request today. I can't give you a firm date from this desk, the crew supervisor sets the schedule. But it'll be on the list as a dry-weather drainage problem, which gets looked at differently than storm stuff."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:00:26-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Differently how, slower?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:00:28-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not slower, just they'll want to see if it's a clogged line or a broken pipe. Can I get a number in case they need to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:00:39-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. 401-555-0192. That's a landline, so if I'm not here, leave a message."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:00:44-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0192. You'll hear from someone this week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:00:48-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll believe it when the pond's gone. Thanks, Kevin."
    }
  ],
